# Malian World Music TOUR with Bassidi Kone

# [![Malian World Music Tour](/media/2013/06/Bassidi-Balaphon-LR.jpg)](/malian-world-music-tour/bassidi-balaphon-lr/)

Don't miss the Malian World Music Tour an awesome event with Bassidi Koné from Mali, West Africa and Sunshine Coast's Nathaniel Combs. If you like to dance and listen to world class music performed by phenomenal Malian drummer, Bassidi Koné then this is the gig for you! Get ready to get your groove on and be blown away by incredible African drumming and duo performance with this special one off event at Mandala Arts Cafe! DRUM ON!

## Malian World Music Tour Events

Mandala Arts Cafe, Gold Coast 4/2558 Gold Coast Hwy, Mermaid Beach Gold Coast Saturday July 13th 6.30- 9pm
